id=netstats-fix
name=EvoX GSI Network Stats Fix
version=v2.0
versionCode=2
author=Flint
description=Fixes broken network traffic indicator and per-UID network stats on EvoX GSI. Attempts to repair BPF program loading from the tethering APEX so NetworkStatsService can read per-UID byte counters. Falls back to interface-level stats and collects detailed diagnostics when BPF repair is not possible.
